<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>BYU Ryde | OKR dashboard</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/okr.css?v=demo-polish-20261118"></head>
<body><main>
<a href="/">&larr; Back to The Ryde</a>
<header><p class="eyebrow">BYU RYDE &middot; PROJECT IMPACT</p><h1>Small steps. More rides.</h1><p>Our objectives and key results, measured through real rider activity.</p><button id="refresh" type="button">Refresh counters</button><p id="status" role="status">Loading counters&hellip;</p></header>
<section aria-labelledby="adoption"><p class="eyebrow">OBJECTIVE 1</p><h2 id="adoption">Build Rider Adoption</h2><div class="metrics">
<article><p>KR 1 &middot; Accounts Created</p><strong data-metric="account_registrations">&mdash;</strong><p>Registered rider accounts.</p></article>
<article><p>KR 2 &middot; Routes Saved</p><strong data-metric="routes_saved">&mdash;</strong><p>Routes currently saved as favorites.</p></article>
</div></section>
<section aria-labelledby="travel"><p class="eyebrow">OBJECTIVE 2</p><h2 id="travel">Help Riders Navigate Campus</h2><div class="metrics">
<article><p>KR 1 &middot; Trip Routes Viewed</p><strong data-metric="trips_planned">&mdash;</strong><p>Trip routes opened on the interactive map.</p></article>
<article><p>KR 2 &middot; Walking Directions Opened</p><strong data-metric="directions_clicked">&mdash;</strong><p>Google Maps walking directions opened.</p></article>
</div></section><footer>Totals reflect saved activity. Refresh to see the latest counts.</footer>
</main><script src="/js/okr.js?v=demo-polish-20261118"></script></body></html>
